[
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "欢迎来到KC桌面。今天我们用一份最新\n研报，拆一个值得继续跟踪的问题。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 6.78,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "KC桌面",
      "最新研报"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "最近网易发了2026年第一季度的财报\n，你看了吗？",
    "start": 7.14,
    "end": 12.202,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "网易",
      "2026年第一季度",
      "财报"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "看了，确实挺有意思的。这份报告说，网\n易一季度营收306亿，同比增长6%，\n比市场预期还高了4%。",
    "start": 12.562,
    "end": 22.361,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "一季度",
      "营收306亿",
      "同比增长6%"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "6%的增长，在现在这个环境下算不错了\n吧？",
    "start": 22.721,
    "end": 27.179,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "6%",
      "增长",
      "环境"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "关键是，它是在去年高基数的基础上做到\n的。而且游戏业务的毛利率创了历史新高\n，达到74.8%。",
    "start": 27.539,
    "end": 38.174,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "去年高基数",
      "游戏业务",
      "毛利率"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "8%的毛利率？这个数字在游戏行业里算\n什么水平？",
    "start": 38.534,
    "end": 43.41,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "8%",
      "毛利率",
      "游戏行业"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "非常高了。比去年同期提升了6个百分点\n，也比研究员自己预期的70%要高出不\n少。",
    "start": 43.77,
    "end": 51.108,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "去年同期",
      "6个百分点",
      "研究员"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那为什么毛利能提升这么多？是游戏本身\n更赚钱了，还是别的什么原因？",
    "start": 51.468,
    "end": 57.737,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "毛利",
      "提升",
      "游戏"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告里提到两个核心原因。一个是收入结\n构变了，更高毛利的PC游戏占比在提升\n。另一个是渠道成本在下降，",
    "start": 58.097,
    "end": 67.896,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "收入结构",
      "PC游戏",
      "占比"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "也就是应用商店的分成比例降低了。",
    "start": 68.256,
    "end": 71.042,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "应用商店",
      "分成比例",
      "降低"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "所以这其实反映了网易在PC端游上的优\n势？我听说《梦幻西游》电脑版的最高同\n时在线人数创了新纪录？",
    "start": 71.402,
    "end": 81.526,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "网易",
      "PC端游",
      "优势"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "没错，一季度最高同时在线达到了390\n万。而且不只是《梦幻西游》，",
    "start": 81.886,
    "end": 88.759,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "一季度",
      "最高同时在线",
      "390万"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "像《燕云十六声》和《天下》这些老牌P\nC游戏也在贡献增长。",
    "start": 89.119,
    "end": 94.181,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "燕云十六声",
      "天下",
      "老牌PC游戏"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那新游戏呢？市场一直在等网易的新品储\n备。",
    "start": 94.541,
    "end": 99.046,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "新游戏",
      "市场",
      "网易"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告里特别提到了一个叫《湮灭之潮》的\n新游戏，预计三季度上线。",
    "start": 99.406,
    "end": 105.768,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "湮灭之潮",
      "新游戏",
      "三季度上线"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "研究员认为它可能成为下半年游戏增长的\n重要催化剂。",
    "start": 106.128,
    "end": 111.004,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "研究员",
      "下半年",
      "游戏增长"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "三季度上线，具体是什么时候？",
    "start": 111.364,
    "end": 114.244,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "三季度上线"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "报告里说，可能是7月份。因为暑期档是\n游戏旺季，早一点上线能抓住最好的窗口\n期。",
    "start": 114.604,
    "end": 122.591,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "7月份",
      "暑期档",
      "游戏旺季"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "那除了游戏业务，网易其他板块表现怎么\n样？",
    "start": 122.951,
    "end": 126.759,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "游戏业务",
      "网易",
      "其他板块"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "云音乐和网易有道都还算平稳，但创新业\n务收入略有下滑。整体看，游戏才是利润\n的核心引擎。",
    "start": 127.119,
    "end": 136.268,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "云音乐",
      "网易有道",
      "平稳"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这份报告里有没有提到什么风险或者还没\n完全展开的细节？",
    "start": 136.628,
    "end": 142.061,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "风险",
      "细节"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "有一个点挺关键的，就是网易在香港的二\n次上市转为主要上市的时间表，报告里没\n有给出明确更新。按照港交所规则，",
    "start": 142.421,
    "end": 153.149,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "香港",
      "二次上市",
      "主要上市"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "网易从2026年2月开始有一年的窗口\n期来完成这个转换。",
    "start": 153.509,
    "end": 158.014,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "网易",
      "2026年2月",
      "一年"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "这个转换如果完成，对读者来说有什么意\n义？",
    "start": 158.374,
    "end": 162.925,
    "voice_id": "UFDAUkGzdLAEJlINT3Fx",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "转换",
      "读者",
      "意义"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这个就值得去读完整报告了。另外，报告\n里还提到了一些关于《梦幻西游》手游流\n水可能低于预期的风险，",
    "start": 163.285,
    "end": 172.805,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "完整报告",
      "梦幻西游",
      "手游"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_B",
    "text": "这些细节我们今天就先不展开了。",
    "start": 173.165,
    "end": 175.626,
    "voice_id": "bhJUNIXWQQ94l8eI2VUf",
    "tts_engine": "elevenlabs",
    "highlight_terms": [
      "细节",
      "展开"
    ],
    "page_index": 1,
    "page_count": 1
  },
  {
    "speaker": "ZH_A",
    "text": "看来完整报告里还有更多值得深挖的内容\n。如果大家对这份研报的完整版本感兴趣\n，可以加入我们的社群获取。",
    "start": 175.986,
